{"t": 1793374900545, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "lost", "Navigation: no map, compass, waypoint or objective marker. Houses are labelled only when close, back yards are pitch black, and with the clock at ~3 s per game minute I lost ~40 game minutes (7:30-8:15) wandering behind the Okafors'/Mr. Hale's houses looking for 'Mr. Hale's back step' and then for Nana's herb bed. A minimap or a NEXT line with a direction ('two doors east of Nana's') would help a lot."]}
