{"t": 1793375079884, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "nobag", "After changing back from cat at Ms. Bright's porch, NEXT says 'Fetch your candy bag from where you changed (E)', but the bag is not marked in the world or on the HUD. Several 90-degree scans of the yard over ~20 game minutes (9:00-9:17) never showed it. Also the HUD block (8 lines, wraps further in cat form) covers the top-left third of the view and hides things behind it. Expected a glint/label on the bag or a 'bag: behind you' hint."]}
