{"t": 1793375137861, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "pace", "Pace: at ~3 s per game minute plus several FPS of input lag (mouse-look often applied a beat late, so turns overshot), 4h15m of night (5:20-9:36) went by in ~14 wall minutes and I completed only 2 knocks and 2 of 4 lanterns; never reached Smoke's paw prints or the cider. Porch lights went off at 9 pm before the '6 to go' knocks were possible. Under this renderer the night feels too short for the amount of searching required."]}
